Description: CVE-2026-89147 does not affect Alpine 3.23 net-snmp 5.9.5.2-r0
 The SMUX pre-auth blocking read exists in upstream smux.c through 5.9.5.2, but
 Alpine does not compile the smux MIB module. default_modules.h has no smux
 entry, the APKBUILD does not pass --with-mib-modules=smux, and the shipped
 snmpd / libnetsnmp* binaries contain no SMUX objects. A code backport of
 smux.c would not change the agent. This dummy only adds a security note.
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/net-snmp/net-snmp/blob/v5.9.5.2/agent/mibgroup/smux/smux.c
Bug: https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/net-snmp-through-5.9.5.2-denial-of-service-via-blocking-unauthenticated-smux-read
Last-Update: 2026-09-30

--- /dev/null
+++ b/ROOT-SECURITY-RELEASE-CVE-2026-89147.md
@@ -0,0 +1,35 @@
+# Security Release Notes — net-snmp (CVE-2026-89147)
+
+## Overview
+
+**CVE-2026-89147** is a **false positive** for Alpine 3.23 **net-snmp 5.9.5.2-r0**
+(aports tag **v3.23.5**, which is what `alpine:3.23` / alpine-patcher builds).
+The upstream defect is a blocking `recvfrom()` in `smux_accept()` before
+authentication, which stalls the single-threaded `snmpd` main loop when a
+client connects to TCP/199 and sends nothing. That path is compiled only when
+the `smux` MIB module is enabled. Alpine's default module list does not
+include it, and the package does not pass `--with-mib-modules=smux`.
+
+## Evidence
+
+- `agent/mibgroup/default_modules.h` in the 5.9.5.2 tarball has no
+  `config_require(smux)`.
+- aports `v3.23.5` `main/net-snmp/APKBUILD` (`pkgver=5.9.5.2`, `pkgrel=0`)
+  has no `smux` configure flag. `# secfixes:` does not list this CVE because
+  the module is absent, not because a later version bump fixed it.
+- The shipped `snmpd` and `libnetsnmp*` libraries and archives contain no
+  `smux` symbols. `SMUX-MIB.txt` is only a MIB text file.
+- A stock `snmpd` listens on `udp:127.0.0.1:161` and does not open TCP/199.
+
+| Attribute | Value |
+|-----------|--------|
+| **Vulnerable function** | `smux_accept()` in `agent/mibgroup/smux/smux.c` |
+| **Affected upstream** | net-snmp through 5.9.5.2 when SMUX is compiled in |
+| **Alpine 3.23 package** | net-snmp 5.9.5.2-r0 (v3.23.5), SMUX not built |
+| **Advisory** | https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/net-snmp-through-5.9.5.2-denial-of-service-via-blocking-unauthenticated-smux-read |
+
+### Recommendation
+
+- Treat **CVE-2026-89147** as **not applicable** to Alpine 3.23 net-snmp
+  5.9.5.2-r0. Do not apply a code backport of `smux.c`; the file is not
+  linked into the agent.
